      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/retrogamedeals.bsky.social/post/3mzg6fsai3z2r",
      "text": "Going from the voice casts of Day of the Tentacle and Sam & Max straight to RE1 is quite a jump. Those LucasArts games set the bar high.",
